  "term": "GPT",
  "definition": "GPT refers here to a large language model used to generate answers and probability judgments. In this study, GPT-5 showed more internally consistent probabilistic reasoning than naïve human participants, with few conjunction or disjunction errors and near-perfect respect for binary complementarity.",
